<tr><td>SMS without a channel strategy</td><td>Separate customer service SMS duties from email duties</td><td>Customer Service frequency collision sheds subscribers</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="mt-12">Implementation order for a customer service program</h2>
<ol>
<li>Map customer service consent sources into the platform before any customer service campaign.</li>
<li>Prove customer service-critical Shopify events — order, cart, refund, support — fire in a test store.</li>
<li>Set customer service guardrails before constructing journeys.</li>
<li>Pilot customer service with one bounded journey plus holdout measurement.</li>
<li>For customer service, the thirty-day read covers profit and list health.</li>
<li>Customer Service expansion needs two-operator safety.</li>
<li>Customer Service peak policy locks edits, codes, cadence.</li>
<li>Quarterly, weigh the customer service stack against attributed margin.</li>
<li>Retire or trim customer service flows untouched for ninety days.</li>
</ol>
